					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960204,
					"content": "咳咳！派蒙有些饿了，我们去餐厅看看菜单吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960205,
					"content": "（拿着这个箱子的人，应该就是前来交易的家伙了吧。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960206,
					"content": "（那么，接下来就是正题了。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960207,
					"content": "可恶，就这么把人拖过来…这是轻视生命的举动！我要去审判庭告你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960208,
					"content": "是吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960209,
					"content": "我倒是觉得，我好心将你从「观众」面前带走，是在维护你的面子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960210,
					"content": "至于你在途中是头朝上还是头朝下，不是你自己的选择吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960211,
					"content": "你…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960212,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960213,
					"content": "好吧，好吧，我承认，是我不对。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960214,
					"content": "唉…我当然知道什么是对什么是错，但实在没办法，因为我真的很需要这笔钱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960215,
					"content": "我本来是研究古遗迹的专家，家庭美满，工作顺利。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960216,
					"content": "但谁能想到，自己的儿子竟然被人蛊惑，陷入了赌博的泥沼…家里本来有些积蓄，但架不住钱就像瀑布一样流走…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960217,
					"content": "欠债以后，他时常遭到债主威胁恐吓，我作为亲生父亲，又怎么能眼睁睁看着他遭遇这种事呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960218,
					"content": "唉，我儿子就像你这般年纪，如果他也能像你一样健康成长就好了…所以我才需要钱！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960219,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960220,
					"content": "你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960221,
					"content": "求求你了，小伙子，帮帮忙吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960222,
					"content": "看在我们都是纳塔同胞的份上，饶我一命！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960223,
					"content": "如果我回去，还有机会管教好我那不争气的儿子。但如果我被抓，他可能只有死路一条了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960224,
					"content": "作为家人，理应为了更好的未来一起战斗的，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960225,
					"content": "我们全家的机会都在你的手上了，求求你，高抬贵手吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960226,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960227,
					"content": "哈哈，基尼奇，基尼奇，怎么不说话？难道心软了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿乔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960228,
					"content": "哼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960229,
					"content": "我不会相信你说的任何一句话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960230,
					"content": "莱欧斯利还真是猜对了八成，你就是一个彻头彻尾的赌徒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960231,
					"content": "呃，赌徒？我？怎么可能，都说了是我儿子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960232,
					"content": "首先，你真的是纳塔人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960233,
					"content": "如果你一直关注着那把枪的动向，应该不会连一个熟悉的面孔都认不出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960234,
					"content": "而比起这个，说「审判庭」的时候倒是顺口得很。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960235,
					"content": "什么啊，就凭这个…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960236,
					"content": "我，我可以解释的！我…我其实是从小生活在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安格尔望"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960237,
					"content": "啧，真是一句话都不想再听了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960238,
					"content": "阿乔，给你一个堵别人嘴的机会，怎么样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960239,
					"content": "哈哈哈，等你这句话好久了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿乔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960240,
					"content": "没脸皮的老东西，吃我一拳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿乔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960241,
					"content": "赌徒的特征之一就是谎话连篇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960242,
					"content": "我猜你只是假扮成纳塔人的枫丹人罢了，身边也没有什么家人朋友。即便有，他们也早就因为你的不知廉耻离去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960243,
					"content": "当然，我也有猜错的可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960244,
					"content": "——但那又如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960245,
					"content": "我只负责抓人，既不是你的代理人，也不是你的贴心听众。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960246,
					"content": "而从你口中挖出真相，是你最喜欢的审判庭的职责。对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960247,
					"content": "没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960248,
					"content": "基尼奇先生，好久不见。这名犯人就由特巡队接管了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960249,
					"content": "啊，辛苦你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960250,
					"content": "哪里，还是要再次感谢你的鼎力协助。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960251,
					"content": "我的呢？我的呢？无礼！难道不应该向伟大圣龙表达诚挚感谢吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿乔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960252,
					"content": "那好吧，谢谢你和咔库库先生的精彩演出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "夏沃蕾"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960253,
					"content": "啊——什么意思啊你，站住——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿乔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960254,
					"content": "基尼奇，你还好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960255
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960255,
					"content": "被一路拖行的人又不是我，放心吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960256
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960256,
					"content": "感觉你刚刚心情不好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960257
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960257,
					"content": "噗噗，小小基尼奇，是想起小小小小基尼奇的事情了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960258
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿乔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960258,
					"content": "可别哭鼻子哦！伟大圣龙要是有这么懦弱的下仆，也是会没面子的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960259
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿乔"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960259,
					"content": "什么跟什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960260
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960260,
					"content": "阿乔，坏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960261
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960261,
					"content": "也没有瞒你的必要，简单来讲，我确实很讨厌赌徒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960262
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960262,
					"content": "他们是世界上最没有责任心，最不尊重付出与回报的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960263
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960263,
					"content": "为了一枚硬币，他们可以编出千万个谎言，再妄图通过这枚硬币，赌出千万的财富。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960264
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960264,
					"content": "但我们都清楚，凭空得到的东西，背后总暗藏着无法想象的代价。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960265
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960265,
					"content": "我从前的生活已经是我父亲赌输代价的一部分了。如果可以，我不希望有其他人陷入类似的境遇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960266
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960266,
					"content": "基尼奇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960267
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960267,
					"content": "不用为我难过，我自己也并不觉得难过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960268
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960268,
					"content": "都说人是由过去组成。而既然我能走到现在这一步，那说明我一定做对了很多很多事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960269
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960269,
					"content": "不要因他人的过失惩戒自己。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960270
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960270,
					"content": "我的话，会选择记得那些让我成长的瞬间。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960271
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960271,
					"content": "就像我第一次学会使用钩索——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960272
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960272,
					"content": "第一次渴求知识的时候。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960273
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960273,
					"content": "我明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960274
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401960274,
					"content": "嗯，我相信你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401960275
					],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				},
				{
					"id": 401960275,
					"content": "走吧。再不回去，会有更多人产生不必要的担心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "基尼奇"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4019603,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4019604,
				4019606
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
